  "details": "I've tested several avatars using the new hand tracking on Quest 2 and I've found that, in almost all cases, the posture of the thumb can look quite strange and doesn't match the posture I'm making in real life.\nThe thumb sometimes clips into the palm of the hand and sometimes goes almost behind the index finger.\nTo better understand, please see my video demonstration with a fuller explanation: \nhttps://youtu.be/DueKGnddReM",
